# Whitelist (2026-09-30): the backend image gets ONLY requirements.txt and backend/ (minus tests and caches).
# So everything on the HANDOFF §4 hide list stays out: data/ (incl. dfc2019/experiments), external/, desktop/ (incl.
# desktop/tauri build artifacts), docs/ (incl. design-reference), frontend/ (incl. dist/, .vercel/), AWSCLIV2.pkg,
# configs/, models/, space/, notebooks, scripts, tests. The image never carries tile data, checkpoints or secrets.
*
!requirements.txt
!backend/
!docker/
backend/tests/
backend/**/__pycache__
backend/**/*.pyc
